# deploy/demo.env.example — the demo deploy's configuration
# (scripts/deploy-demo.sh; make deploy-demo, stop-demo, prewarm-art).
#
# Copy it to deploy/demo.env (gitignored) and set what your box needs. The file
# is sourced by bash: one VAR=value per line, quoted when the value has spaces.
# A variable set in the environment wins over the file, so `PACE=1s make
# deploy-demo` changes one deploy. Every variable is optional; the value shown
# is the script's default (<GORGE_ROOT> stands for the checkout), and a
# commented-out line keeps it.

# --- The checkout, the binary and its inputs -------------------------------
# The gorge checkout the demo builds and serves from (default: this checkout).
#GORGE_ROOT=/path/to/gorge
# The server binary make deploy-demo builds and the deploy runs. It must be
# named gorged: the stop sweep matches /proc/<pid>/comm exactly.
#BIN=<GORGE_ROOT>/bin/gorged
# The card corpus (make fetch-cards), the deck lists and the feedback reports.
#CARDS=<GORGE_ROOT>/.cards
#DECKS=<GORGE_ROOT>/testkit/testutil/decks
#FEEDBACK=<GORGE_ROOT's main worktree>/feedback

# --- Ports and the stop sweep ------------------------------------------------
# The public server listens on 127.0.0.1:PUB_PORT (gorged's own default port).
#PUB_PORT=8080
# A second, omniscient server; empty runs none.
#OMNI_PORT=
# Every port this box's demo has ever listened on, space-separated and
# append-only (scripts/demo-ports.sh): the sweep stops a gorged still listening
# on a retired port. Add a port here when a layout first binds it.
#DEMO_PORT_HISTORY="8080 8081"
# One-off extra ports to sweep.
#RETIRED_PORTS=
# ports: stop only the gorged listening on those ports at the addresses the
# deploy binds. all: stop every listening gorged on the box.
#SWEEP=ports

# --- Persistence and logs ----------------------------------------------------
# Wiped and recreated on every deploy. Keep them out of the checkout, and give
# every server on the box its own: servers sharing one directory corrupt it.
#PUB_DIR=/tmp/gorge-demo-pub
#OMNI_DIR=/tmp/gorge-demo-omni
#PUB_LOG=/tmp/gorge-demo-pub.log
#OMNI_LOG=/tmp/gorge-demo-omni.log

# --- Tables and bots -----------------------------------------------------------
#TABLES=2
#SEATS=2
#COMMANDER_SEATS=4
#FORMATS=constructed,commander
#PACE=50ms
#SEED=1
#SPECTATOR=omniscient
#VSBOT_SPECTATOR=public
#BOT_POLICY=bot
#COMMON_SENSE=false
#DEMO_GOMEMLIMIT=8GiB
#PPROF=false

# --- Card art --------------------------------------------------------------------
# The durable art cache, outside the wiped persistence directories.
#ART_DIR=$HOME/.cache/gorge-demo/art
# Bounds on the pre-start fill (make prewarm-art is strict and unbounded).
#ART_FILL_BUDGET=200s
#ART_FILL_MAX_FAILURES=10
#ART_FILL_CEILING=230s
